## TABLE 9 — form_submissions

Fields:

- id.
- registration_id.
- form_id.
- form_version.
- submitted_by.
- response_data JSONB.
- submitted_at.
- updated_at.

Store structured responses in JSONB while preserving relational identity.

Validate each answer against the exact published form version.

Do not allow arbitrary field injection.

